        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
                "word": "pseudoscientifique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "19582324-52af-4534-b3f0-45865e494e32",
                        "entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "pseudoscientifiques"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "60754cc6-668b-4e03-b3ec-7a8abf23e998",
                        "entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "pseudo-scientifique"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c09edd09-1fa2-3c62-991d-65b61979953f",
                        "entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à une ou plusieurs pseudosciences."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89e888ec-485e-4958-95e5-dfb44be0325a",
                                "sense_id": "c09edd09-1fa2-3c62-991d-65b61979953f",
                                "text": "Le besoin de bien contrôler une population opprimée favorisera une éducation réservée aux privilégiés. Elle débouchera aussi sur un rejet de la science dans des pratiques clairement pseudoscientifiques, telles une coutume astrologique répandue régie par des religieux et une médecine défaillante fondée sur des principes médiévaux."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "41d7f79b-703e-3442-91d7-a53c2c2bfd21",
                        "entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui se présente comme scientifique mais ne l'est pas."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecfda258-9a75-4fb1-a98c-bdd08adcc7c5",
                                "sense_id": "41d7f79b-703e-3442-91d7-a53c2c2bfd21",
                                "text": "En guise de substitut à un véritable programme politique, ces deux mouvements tendent à se réfugier dans de grandes théories, qui, si elles prétendent à un caractère englobant qui leur permet de tout expliquer, laissent surtour voir une lecture généralement superficielle, pseudoscientifique et simpliste de la réalité."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "363d3148-09f2-4674-97ac-bb137216dc81",
                        "source_entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
                        "target_lang_word": "pseudoscientific",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pseudoscientific",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                        "entry_id": "259eb011-bfcc-3378-963c-dbf49067679f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, relating to, or employing pseudoscience; not scientific, though purporting to be scientific."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3c980ba-6af6-49dc-ad40-db6f34770269",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "[…] another example of the desire to control deviant lifestyles: the preparation by the FBI of pseudoscientific \"profiles\" that purport to describe the murderers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e8e3a2e-df5c-4d29-a095-119b59694476",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "Many postsecondary educators are concerned about the rising tide of pseudoscientific, fundamentally anti-intellectual belief among otherwise well educated Americans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b0ad747-c00b-4a2c-93f3-4cebb6590494",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "Some pseudoscientific theories explain what nonbelievers cannot even observe, for example, orgone energy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55f65813-9d7a-4f91-91ad-f828dd698055",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "Don’t let manipulative state legislators misrepresent science and fearmonger you into giving them money. At the very least, don’t let them continue with their false pseudoscientific assertions. Pressure them to do their jobs and introduce real evidence-based legislation – like the Equality Act – that will improve lives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cac54cac-da5c-4939-8c97-e854bb709d5b",
                                                "sense_id": "0d77c49e-4b6e-3f5d-8ef1-9fd66bdc2bd6",
                                                "text": "The trolls did not match the old professional racists’ stuffy style, but they found use in their pseudoscientific graphics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "af16f93f-f0d9-4ebc-b9fa-595768723f30",
                        "source_entry_id": "9df4cf73-7b08-3669-986d-28e59ca3120a",
